interface.longDescription:
MyImage2Life turns an idea or a photo into a real, physical product and delivers it to your door.

Tell it what you want, for example a poster of a fox in a misty forest, a mug with your holiday photo or a black t-shirt with your team's name, and it will:
- find a matching product in a catalogue of posters, canvas and other wall art, t-shirts and hoodies, mugs, greeting cards, calendars, puzzles, cushions and more, with its real options (size, colour, paper, frame);
- create an original design for that product, or use a photo or drawing you add to the chat;
- show an honest print proof: a mockup of the product next to the exact print sheet, with the part that is trimmed off marked, and a quality note if a photo has too few pixels for the size you picked;
- give the total price for your delivery country, including shipping and, in the EU, VAT, with an estimated delivery time;
- when you approve the proof, create the order and open our secure checkout page, where you enter your address and pay. Nothing is printed until you have paid.

A professional print partner prints and ships the order. You can ask about an order at any time with your order number.

What it will not do: copy brands, logos or well-known characters, print content that is illegal, sexual, hateful or extremist, or take payment inside the chat.
